  "design_recommendation": "operation-local scoped TLS or explicit shared operation handle; nonrefundable attempt fuel and sticky failure outside rollback snapshots; checks inside work loops and at mandatory fallible precommit boundaries",
  "actual_critical_edges": [
    "content_pack::load -> generated preview validation -> CombatExecutor resolve -> BattleCore::new_from_database -> start_battle_execution",
    "public run preparation -> world::commit planned active session -> advance_active_battle_by_internal(0,true,0)",
    "same-time heap drain -> process_event -> field work / inner event / reconcile -> wave / startup hooks / boss -> re-drain",
    "process_commands -> execute_committed_damage -> process_command_batches; command/effect/target expansion precedes dispatch",
    "finalize/resolve delivery -> release_deferred_skill_steps -> SkillStep enqueue",
    "spawn mutation Err -> clone rollback -> Ok(Rejected); boss/summon staged clones also restore or install",
    "GameCore clone/draft commit precedes CoreApplication facade serialization; authoring outer candidate required"
  ],
  "material_caveats": [
    "TLS applies to observed synchronous same-thread path; reentry/nesting and future thread propagation must be explicit",
    "infallible helpers can use sticky stop only with prompt caller polls and invariant/context preservation",
    "generate_current_floor_map currently uses expect on fallible generation; deep control Err must not panic",
    "no fake entity/cast/event identities or incomplete constructor sentinels",
    "queue pending size differs from same-time bucket allocation and cumulative work",
    "Rapier external calls lack observed local cancellation hooks; no measured wall-time bound claimed",
    "no numerical limit, exhaustive all-opcode coverage, allocator safety or broad R23 completion asserted"
  ],
